      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CANYA JUMP (1) produced a moderate performance last time when fifth at Angle Park over 530m behind Canya Adira (31.29) in a Grade 5. Was in the money prior to that. The form out of her last race has been franked. Can bounce back. OREGON JANET (5) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by 12 lengths at Angle Park in a handy 43.91 beating Canya Concorde. Winner at her latest appearance in the quickest time on the card. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. PRIME VOLTAGE (3) settled midfield in the run and boxed on to finish there when 5th (25.97) at this track. Has performed well from this box with a win and five minor placings to his name from 11 starts. Key runner who gets his chance to atone. FANTASTIC HELGA (7) with some luck can improve on an unplaced run last time here.",
